{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And from the head of the ancient mountains.</b> An expression of praise, like ראשית תבואתו, כי הוא ראשית אונו, ראשית שמנים ימשחו — the meaning is: from the best of all the mountains that were created from the six days of Genesis." "<b>The ancient mountains.</b> The land of Ephraim, the portion of the sons of Joseph, was a land of mountains, as it is written: צופים מהר אפרים."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:27.589420406Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}